        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Scorpio — 2nd Technique, gained at level 6.</em></p><p>The scarlet haze that comes before Antares.</p><p><strong>Requirements</strong> The target has at least 1 needle.</p><p>The target must attempt a Will save.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> For 1 minute it is dazzled, treats all other creatures as concealed, and takes @Damage[1d6[mental]] damage per needle it currently has at the end of each of its turns.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, and it is confused for 1 round as the mirage overtakes it entirely.</p><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> At 10th, 14th, and 18th level, the per-needle damage increases by 1d6.</p><p><em>On a day your constellation is Ascendant this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a Zenith, 8 levels higher.</em></p>"
